@modes
new-page: true

= The role of PPS

- @mode_member
- @mode_external_support
- @mode_opposition
- @back

@mode_member
title: PPS enters the cabinet
subtitle: PPS ministers and full responsibility for the government.
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.draftChoiceStatus(Q, 'mode', 'member').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: A cabinet of experts has no party ministers.
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'pps_mode', 'member');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@mode_external_support
title: PPS supports the cabinet from outside
subtitle: No PPS ministries; the programme is the condition of support; half the responsibility.
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'pps_mode', 'external_support');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@mode_opposition
title: PPS stays in opposition
subtitle: No partner's agreement is needed; the other parties form a cabinet if they can.
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.setDraft(Q, 'pps_mode', 'opposition');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@portfolio_menu
new-page: true

= PPS portfolios

Partners receive their preferred portfolios automatically, the larger club first; the others go to non-party experts. Public works are part of Labour.

- @claim_labor
- @claim_plus
- @claim_instead
- @back

